  "bodyHash": "f89ff25ef8bc65f8",
  "content": "\n\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>建议单人游玩。</strong></span><br>那里潜伏着一只令人不安的怪物：它拥有诡异的智慧与变幻的形态。在它现身之前，你只能通过遥远的低语、转瞬即逝的阴影、细微的变化以及被窥视的压迫感来察觉它的存在。<br><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>追逐者（Chase）</strong></span>和<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化（Decay）</span></strong>是其中两种可以被消灭的形态。<br>然而，你需要找到并摧毁它们的<strong>心<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">脏</span></strong>才能将其彻底消灭。<br><br>只要<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化</span></strong>在你的世界中存在，你将持续承受<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">衰败诅咒</span></strong>的折磨。<br><br>它不仅仅是狩猎。<br>它在操控你的思绪。<br><br>你会成为下一个受害者，还是在这场游戏中幸存下来？<br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_bd9c9e4d-0db5-448d-bb92-5e6458141ea5.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"80\"><br><br><br></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>动态遭遇</strong>：<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>蒙面者（Masked）</strong></span>的出现遵循不可预测的模式和触发条件。<br><br><strong>不可预测的AI</strong>：由于为混乱而生，<strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">蒙面者</span></strong>的行为每次都会变化，让你始终保持紧张。<br><br><strong>深度沉浸</strong>：环境氛围、令人不安的事件以及视听干扰都是沉浸体验的重要组成部分。<br><br><strong>多种形态</strong>：直面<strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">蒙面者</span></strong>的恐怖变体，例如<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化</span></strong>和<strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">追逐者</span></strong>。<br><br><strong>心脏与弱点</strong>：你必须摧毁<strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">追逐者的</span></strong>或<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化的</span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心</span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">脏</span></strong>才能击杀它们。<br><br><strong>尸体与血腥</strong>：遭遇结束后会留下尸体、鲜血和<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> <strong>心</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">脏</span></strong>，同时还会生成全新的结构以加剧恐怖氛围。<br><br><strong>新事件与机制</strong>：创新的玩法转折，让你始终猜不透下一步。<br><br><strong>可配置体验</strong>：通过 <strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a></span></strong>模组调整生成频率、强度、行为及特殊事件。（数值越小表示出现越频繁，数值越大表示越稀有。）</pre>\n</div>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_10001d9d-88b3-48ff-be67-cad1ef06d717.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"80\"><br><br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">尸体</span>清理器</strong><br><br>尸体不会自行消失；你可以清理它们以获取血肉，用于制作<strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">脏</span></span> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">高亮装置</span></strong>，也可以任由这些恐怖之物留存。<br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_e7dc331a-83bb-4014-8037-7dfecbbe7769.png\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span><br><br>右键点击<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>悬挂尸体</strong></span>或<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>地面尸体</strong></span>即可清除。<br><br>使用后，清理器会变脏。<br><br>在<strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">水</span></strong>中清洗即可重复使用。<br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心</span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">脏</span></span>高亮装置</strong><br><br>根据周围环境的不同，<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">红心</span></strong>和<strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">灰心</span></strong>都可能难以寻找。你可以借助此装置识别出需要摧毁的活性心脏。<br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_1665cf33-c5bf-425e-99c7-800e0d519603.png\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span><br><br>手持<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心</span>脏</span>高亮装置</strong>。<br><br>任何当前处于<em>存活</em>状态的<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>灰心</strong></span>或<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>红心</strong></span>都会获得<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>发光效果</strong></span>，便于定位。<br><br>发光效果仅在手持装置时有效。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_0095b49c-974b-49e9-b65d-4b552a5d3da6.png\" width=\"227\" height=\"74\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Upsidedowntree</span><em><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"> </span>- 美术/3D美术与动画</em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">VantablackDEV</span> - 测试员/协助者</em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Knvifrr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knvif</a> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">蒙面者</span></strong> </span>配音灵感来源</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Monty</span></span></span><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"> - 动画与代码</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">Brguiireal - 测试员/协助者</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">TournamenU</span> - 美术/3D美术</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">ClouddyVR</span><em> - 动画</em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Ebalia</span></span></span><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"> - 创意与代码</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em>Nempth <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 创意与美术</span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#4069c6\"><em><br></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_4bed5646-5f75-4a00-9b7a-99f313ebc9eb.png\" width=\"148\" height=\"148\"></a></span></pre>",
